cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this replication and its audit, cite it together with the OBM paper it verifies."
title: "Verifiable replication of Open Bitcoin Metrics (OBM) v0.1.0"
abstract: >-
  An independent reimplementation, from our own Bitcoin Core full node and our own code, of the
  23 daily series published by Open Bitcoin Metrics (OBM) v0.1.0, plus a reproducibility audit of
  those series. 21 of the 23 series are bit-exact against the official snapshot; the two that
  differ are the Coin Days Destroyed series, at one unit of the last published decimal.
authors:
  - family-names: "Martínez"
    given-names: "Byron Josué"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-08"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - bitcoin
  - on-chain metrics
  - reproducibility
  - open data
references:
